title: 'SwapFirstAssetTrader: refund the whole fee held'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `SwapFirstAssetTrader::refund_weight` refused any refund worth the fee it held or more, so a
    `RefundSurplus` of the whole purchase, or of a surplus larger than what this trader bought,
    refunded nothing and the fee went to `OnUnbalanced`. It now caps the refund at the fee held
    and refunds that, as `UsingComponents`, `FixedRateOfFungible` and `TakeFirstAssetTrader` do.
crates:
- name: cumulus-primitives-utility
  bump: patch
